*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.psd binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.zip binary
*.mapproj binary
*.mbtiles binary
